{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のNOGIBINGO!\nアンダー企画です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたや！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地上波で\nアンダーだけで30分もいただけるなんて\nわーお！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お願いします！\n見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日\nママとご飯を食べていた時のこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/19/1337521/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣にまあまあ高めのパーテーションがあったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのパーテーションから\n「ふぇ～」と声が聞こえてくると思ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/19/1337521/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔でこっちを見る赤ちゃんが出てきたり\n引っ込んだりしてたの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高い高いされてるんだと思う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/19/1337521/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に癒されました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん、待てよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/19/1337521/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あちらのご家族は\nどんなつもりで何回も高い高いをしているのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご家族と言ったけど\nママ友会かもしれないし\nあちらにどんな人達が座ってるかもわからない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、\n高い高いしてる人は明らかに\n赤ちゃんがこっちを見て「ふぇ～」と言っていたのは\nわかってるはず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーテーションのこっち側から見た景色は\n想像できてたと思う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし、あちらのご家族(仮)が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちに、\nストレス社会の現代に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとときの癒しを与えようとしてくれてたのなら\nそんなパフォーマンス精神を中田は見習いたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あれ？もしかして中田は\n大事な何かを見落としてるんじゃないか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/19/1337521/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねば～る君 的な感じなのかも\nあの赤ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに小さい時から\nそんなパフォーマンス精神を身に付けていたのなら\nもう師匠と呼ばせてほしい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことを思った\n土曜日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/19/1337521/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の中田画伯"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これでも上手くなった方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}